minimal_patch:
在 syncDailyBoard 的恢复分支中，将 recoverArtifact 返回 false 且原状态为 'generation_started' 的座位直接降级为 'generation_failed_no_repurchase'，使其能被下一轮 syncFailedSeat 消费；同时为 syncFailedSeat 增加可失败证据路径。具体修改：

在 syncDailyBoard 内：
```js
recoverArtifact(root,record,agent,seat);
if (seat.status === 'generation_started') {
  seat.status = 'generation_failed_no_repurchase';
  seat.sync_reason = 'no_unique_complete_artifact_outcome_unknown';
  saveLedger(root,record);
  continue;
}
```

并将 syncFailedSeat 的调用条件改为：
```js
if(seat.assignment&&seat.claim_verified&&['missing_required_section','generation_failed_no_repurchase','failure_sync_unknown','failed_no_repurchase','generation_unknown_no_repurchase'].includes(seat.status)){await syncFailedSeat({root,record,agent,seat,snapshot,command,readRemote,now});continue;}
```
